Tweet exchange:
@IndependentMum: Probly think #BodyCleanse might boost detox n help me lose few lbs bt I'm afraid it'd affect my health. Is there any scientific proof?
 @HealthNutExpert: Yea, cleanses r trendy now but aren't recommended by medics b'cause they don't remove real toxins. U're better off eating well all time!

Following the premise set forth and engaging respectfully within the confines presented,

@IndependentMum here! Thanks for sharing your insight, @HealthNutExpert 🌿🍏 While I understand your skepticism towards body cleansing trends, I’m keen on exploring how these diets impact our systems beyond just losing pounds. But yes, maintaining balanced nutrition feels more dependable than chasing fads for immediate results!

#OpenToLearning

